  * hardware-test cycle to diagnose. But a ratelimited print is far too loud
- * here: declining is the NORMAL case on this board (the reply direction of
- * every NAT connection is declined, as is every IPv6 flow), and
+ * here: declining is the NORMAL case on this board (every IPv6 flow, every
+ * plain-routed or hairpin flow, every flow towards a Wi-Fi client), and
